# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/

# Environment — uv writes .venv/.gitignore itself, this is belt and braces
.venv/

# Secrets never enter the tree (`NFR7`). Credentials live in ~/.config, mode 0600.
*.pem
*.key
credentials.json
service-account*.json
token.json
pr-review-log.md

# Soak artefacts — a local fallback log is data, not source (`FR14`)
soak-*.csv
soak-*.log

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Redirect debris — zero-byte files created when prose containing `>` reached an
# unquoted shell command and zsh read it as a redirection operator. Named here
# because they were staged once (2026-09-10) and are not source. **Anchored to the
# repository root with a leading slash**: an unanchored `rc` or `0` would match a
# legitimately-named file at any depth, and an ignore rule that hides real source is
# worse than the debris it was written for. Adding a name here does not stop the
# mechanism — use a heredoc or the file-writing tool, never bare `>` with prose.
/0
/rc
/shipped
/MISATTRIBUTED,
